{"title":"Substack sent a push alert promoting a Nazi blog","link":"https://www.usermag.co/p/substack-sent-a-push-alert-promoting-nazi-white-supremacist-blog","date":1753831615000,"content":"<p><em>To unlock more of my reporting, <a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/subscribe\">become a paid subscriber today</a>! I cannot produce this newsletter and break these important stories without your financial support. <a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/subscribe\">Your money goes directly towards reporting costs</a>.</em></p><p><a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png\" width=\"1407\" height=\"27\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4byi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fad731c0e-8e05-47b8-abe6-56e409603eaf_1407x27.png 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div></div></div></a></figure></div><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!UD1N!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F56d4b182-14f9-43ac-b637-a05a433aa85b_1260x701.png\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!UD1N!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F56d4b182-14f9-43ac-b637-a05a433aa85b_1260x701.png\" width=\"1260\" height=\"701\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!UD1N!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F56d4b182-14f9-43ac-b637-a05a433aa85b_1260x701.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!UD1N!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F56d4b182-14f9-43ac-b637-a05a433aa85b_1260x701.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!UD1N!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F56d4b182-14f9-43ac-b637-a05a433aa85b_1260x701.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!UD1N!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F56d4b182-14f9-43ac-b637-a05a433aa85b_1260x701.png 1456w\" /><div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Substack sent a push alert encouraging users to subscribe to a Nazi newsletter that claimed Jewish people are a sickness and that we must eradicate minorities to build a “White homeland.”</p><p>NatSocToday describes itself as “a weekly newsletter featuring opinions and news important to the National Socialist and White Nationalist Community.”</p><p>The push alert was sent to an undisclosed number of users’ phones on Monday. Some people posted about the app alert on social media, confused why they were being prompted to subscribe to a Nazi blog. </p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PEdB!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F25f92070-49f8-4f28-a347-dcd8642d7384_1000x330.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PEdB!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F25f92070-49f8-4f28-a347-dcd8642d7384_1000x330.jpeg\" width=\"591\" height=\"195.03\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PEdB!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F25f92070-49f8-4f28-a347-dcd8642d7384_1000x330.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PEdB!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F25f92070-49f8-4f28-a347-dcd8642d7384_1000x330.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PEdB!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F25f92070-49f8-4f28-a347-dcd8642d7384_1000x330.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PEdB!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F25f92070-49f8-4f28-a347-dcd8642d7384_1000x330.jpeg 1456w\" /><div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>“I had [a swastika] pop up as a notification and I’m like, wtf is this? Why am I getting this?” one user said. “I was quite alarmed and blocked it.” Some users speculated that Substack had issued the push alert intentionally in order to generate engagement or that it was tied to Substack’s recent fundraising round. Substack is primarily funded by Andreessen Horowitz, a firm whose founders have pushed extreme far right rhetoric. </p><p>“I thought that Substack was just for diaries and things like that,” a user who posted about receiving the alert on his Instagram story told <em>User Mag</em>. “I didn’t realize there was such a prominent presence of the far right on the app.”</p><p><a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p>\n      <p>\n          <a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/p/substack-sent-a-push-alert-promoting-nazi-white-supremacist-blog\">\n              Read more\n          </a>\n      </p>","author":"Taylor Lorenz","siteTitle":"usermag.co","siteHash":"95f273abc07d53f60c12a9877d5e701fc5d46103659afbdcd53f0429eec6280d","entryHash":"b848826133097f938299d8b413052a743aa8806daad361567f30fdca7a5c6396","category":"Sites"}